      en: ["The market hall is a notable example of functional colonial architecture.", "It serves as the main distribution point for produce from the interior.", "Sections are dedicated to traditional medicine and indigenous herbs.", "It is located in the historic transition zone between old and new Bissau.", "The market is most active between 7 AM and 10 AM each day.", "It is a major hub for the sale of the country's famous cashew nuts."],
