      en: ["The monument commemorates the assassination of Amílcar Cabral in 1973.", "January 20th is a significant national holiday known as Heroes' Day.", "The site hosts the annual main state tribute led by the President.", "It is a powerful symbol of the intellectual foundations of the republic.", "The surrounding plaza is a space for public reflection on national values.", "The monument is a key part of the 'historic circuit' in central Bissau."],
